{
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.AmilyCaughtEating": "The mouse-morph is currently eating something from your supplies when you arrive, and guiltily spins around and hides it behind her back when she realizes you've returned. [say: Ah, [name], I'm glad to see you back!] she squeaks hurriedly; she's sincere, but obviously also a little embarrassed. Then she realizes you're not alone. [say: Ah... you do know you have a shark-girl of some sort following you, don't you?] She looks wary; ready to fight or flee if the situation warrants.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.AmilyHissesWarning": "Amily watches as the tigershark goes to explore the camp, then, quick as lightning, zips over to you and hisses into your ear. [say: Don't think I'm not pissed that you didn't talk about this with me beforehand! I'm just not stupid enough to challenge something that dangerous--I've seen shark-girls take down and EAT minotaurs coming to the lake for a drink!] She pinches you sharply, to express her displeasure.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.ApologyKeepsIzma": "You apologize, but tell her that you won't just throw Izma out now. She's here to stay, and the mouse-morph had better make her peace with that--fighting wouldn't work out well for anyone.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.AsksAboutCowgirl": "Izma looks to you curiously once you return to her. [say: So what's your story with her?] she asks. You give a sigh and tell Izma how you met Marble at Whitney's farm and how a relationship formed between you over time. Then you go on about how, sadly, you became addicted to her milk without even realizing its corrupt nature. "
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.BedDistanceCuriosity": "What makes you curious is how she decided to keep her bed at a distance from your own. You give her a wave and tell her it's okay to sleep near you. She looks at you quizzically in response. [say: Well...] she stammers, [say: I thought my Alpha would want me to sleep some distance away,] she says. With a hasty reassurance, you insist that she place her bed closer. Eager to serve, she drags the bedroll adjacent to your own and smiles at you bashfully."
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.BedDistanceDecision": "What makes you curious is how she decides to keep her bed at a distance from your own. You give her a wave and tell her it's okay to sleep near you. She looks at you quizzically in response. [say: Well...] she stammers, [say: I thought my Alpha would want me to sleep some distance away,] she says. With a hasty reassurance, you insist that she place her bed closer. Eager to serve, she drags the bedroll adjacent to your own and smiles at you bashfully.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.ChucklesAtMarbleCamp": "You can't help but chuckle at how eager she is to live with you as you guide her to your camp, and she never seems to shut up talking about how fun it'll be and how much the two of you will be able to fuck. However she stops talking entirely and tilts her head to the side once she sees Marble patrolling around your camp.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.ChucklesDistantBedroll": "You can't help but chuckle at how eager she is to live with you as you guide her to your camp, and she never seems to shut up talking about how fun it'll be and how much the two of you will be able to fuck. The tigershark wastes no time setting up her trunk at the farthest edge of the camp from you and then sets her bedroll up.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.DruggedTwistedRelationship": "drugged you into some twisted relationship"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.ExplainsAmilyHistory": "After that you turn to Izma and explain your past with Amily, the tales of her ruined village, how you grew to love her, and how you fathered many children with her to kickstart the population of untainted mouse-morphs. Izma takes a breath and looks enthralled by your story. [say: That's incredible; amazingly noble, both of you.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.ExplainsSparringHistory": "You give a sigh and explain how you met Izma, what she is, your previous conversations, and your eventual sparring matches. After several defeats at your hands, Izma declared you as her alpha, stating that she'd do anything for you. Figuring that it would be good to have another skilled fighter and a scholar at the camp, you allowed her to move in.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.ForcedSmileMoment": "Marble nods and seems to force a smile. [say: Just give us a moment,] she tells Izma, before taking you by the hand and pulling you to another part of camp rather forcefully. Oh great, it's going to be one of those talks.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.FrownAndGroundScuff": "Izma gives a frown and scuffs the ground with her bare feet. You give a nervous chuckle and try your best to explain the events of how you met Izma, your various sparring matches and how she eventually submitted fully to you after several victories, declaring you as her alpha.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.GritsTeethDislike": "Marble grits her teeth and shake her head. [say: I don't like it, sweetie. I don't like it and I certainly don't support it. Just keep her under control and away from me, and then we'll see,] the cow-girl says, before clopping off in a huff.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.GrowlsDamnCow": "Izma grits her teeth and sucks air through them as you finish your story. [say: That... damn cow...] she growls, making you gulp at her barely contained rage. [saystart]She took you, my perfect alpha, and "
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.KissAftermath": "By the time you pull away from the kiss, both of you are gasping for breath. Strands of saliva still link the two of you. You brush her silver hair behind her ears and tell her you'd be more than happy to have her in your camp. She makes a gleeful noise and hugs you tight, before rushing for her meager supplies and packing them up.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.KissAftermathAgain": "By the time you pull away from the kiss, both of you are gasping for breath. Strands of saliva still link the two of you. You brush her silver hair behind her ears and tell her you'd be more than happy to have her in your camp. She makes a gleeful noise and hugs you tight, before rushing for her meager supplies and packing them up.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.KissAftermathThird": "By the time you pull away from the kiss, both of you are gasping for breath. Strands of saliva still link the two of you. You brush her silver hair behind her ears and tell her you'd be more than happy to have her in your camp. She makes a gleeful noise and hugs you tight, before rushing for her meager supplies and packing them up.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.LakeAndStreamNearby": "[say: Ah, well... the lake isn't too far from here. And I think I saw a stream as we trekked over,] she explains. [say: So long as I get some water on my body routinely, I'll be golden. Plus it'll be nice to get access to some cleaner water.] She grumbles and adjusts the chest in her arms again. [say: Sorry, this thing is getting on my nerves, I gotta put it down.] She walks past to place her trunk down, but flashes a sincere grin as she does. [say: It's been a pleasure to meet you, Amily; I do hope we get to know each other better,] she says.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.LaughsUntilAmilySpotted": "You can't help but laugh at how eager she is to live with you as you guide her to your camp, and she never seems to shut up talking about how fun it'll be and how much the two of you will be able to fuck. However, she stops talking entirely and tilts her head to the side as she spots Amily scurrying around your camp.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.MarbleBeamsAtYou": "She beams as she sees you and trots over. [say: Sweetie, so glad that you're...] The cow-girl trails off as she notices Izma behind you, and her expression seems to darken. [say: Who's this, sweetie?] she asks. Izma smiles warmly and extends her hand. [say: I'm Izma, [name]'s beta,] she says happily. Seems she has no problems with you having another lover, though you're not sure Marble will share those feelings. [say: Beta?] the cow-girl asks, evidently curious, a look of disdain still on her face.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.MilkAddictionUnbroken": "You couldn't break your addiction, and now you'll die without a steady supply of her milk."
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.MilkHoldBroken": "Thankfully, though you were able to break her milk's hold, and you realized you love Marble despite all that transpired between you, letting her move in with you."
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.MumblesWithCuriosity": "[say: You have a point there...] Amily mumbles, staring at Izma with obvious curiosity. [say: Hmm... well, I should keep an eye on her, but I guess she's earned the right to the benefit of the doubt. It might be nice to have somebody else to talk to here in the camp...] She trails off, mumbling, as Izma finally finishes setting up her spot and comes back to you.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.NervousChuckleAssurance": ".[sayend] You give her a nervous chuckle and assure her that this isn't the case, but Izma doesn't want to listen. [say: I'll keep quiet for now, but if that bovine steps out of line...] she trails off and her fangs pop free, before she goes to set up her bedroll and trunk near your own bed. Seems she wants to keep close to your bed to protect you. Or at least, that's your interpretation. You give a sigh and shake your head. It's doubtful these two will ever warm up to each other."
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.ParagraphBreak": "[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.PointsOutRuinedVillage": "You quietly point out that you met Amily in a ruined village by the lake, and ask her what she used to bathe in. She glares at you, but you stand your ground and say that you trust Izma, pointing out that she's different from most of the creatures that have been tainted by the demons. She could have attacked you and tried to rape you on sight--instead, she's been nothing but polite, conversational and self-controlled. Even when the matter of sex came up, she talked with you about it first and made it clear that it was your choice and there would be no repercussions to refusing. How many other beings in this world wouldn't have just raped first and asked questions never?[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.PoliteButWary": "[say: I'll be polite to her, don't worry about that... but are you absolutely sure we can trust her? I'd be very hesitant to accept anything or anyone coming out of that lake,] Amily asks you, watching Izma as she curiously starts poking around at your mutual belongings.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.QuizzicalMouseReply": "Amily just looks at her quizzically. [say: Yes, I am a mouse.] Her voice is ringing with a tone that just screams 'isn't it obvious?'. [say: I'm sorry, I've seen some striped shark-girls before, but I didn't know your kind had a specific term... wait, what was that about being [name]'s beta? What's a beta?][pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.StunnedAndPleased": "[say: I--you really think so?] Amily asks, looking stunned and pleased all at once, blushing with embarrassment at the compliment. Then she shakes her head. [say: Ah, well... I suppose this isn't unexpected. At least she seems to actually have a brain in her head, not like some goblin or cum-drinking faerie... still, you could have at least asked me before you went fooling around with another woman, you know?] she complains.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.SweetieWhatTheHell": "[say: Sweetie, what the hell?!] she hisses once the two of you are out of earshot from Izma. [say: You could have at the very least consulted me on all this, instead of bringing some stranger into the camp! And she's one of those... corrupt monsters from the lake to boot!] she says. She looks far angrier than you've seen her in the past, that's for sure. You give a sigh and try to explain yourself, telling her that despite her appearance Izma is far nicer than any other creature that's come from that lake. She's been kind, considerate, and most importantly she always gave you a choice when it came to sex. That's far more than you could expect from some 'corrupt monster.'[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.ThoughtfulSharkQuestion": "Then she looks thoughtful. [say: Hey, come to think of it, if you're a shark-girl--sorry, tigershark--then how are you going to survive out here? Don't you need to spend about two-thirds of the day underwater to live?] Amily asks, puzzled.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.TiltsHeadAtAmily": "Izma tilts her head to the side and adjusts her spectacles to get a better look at Amily. [say: Well, I'm a tigershark actually,] she says flatly. [say: I'm also [name]'s beta. Who're you? Oh! You're one of those mouse people, right?][pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.WarmShoulderKiss": "You smile warmly and place your hands on her shoulders, before pulling her in and kissing her deeply. Practically melting at your touch and moaning into your mouth, she wraps her arms and tail around your waist.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.WarmShoulderKissAgain": "You smile warmly and place your hands on her shoulders, before pulling her in and kissing her deeply. Practically melting at your touch and moaning into your mouth, she wraps her arms and tail around your waist.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.WarmShoulderKissThird": "You smile warmly and place your hands on her shoulders, before pulling her in and kissing her deeply. Practically melting at your touch and moaning into your mouth, she wraps her arms and tail around your waist.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AcceptIzmaAsYourBitch.WeakDrugAddict": "turned you into some weak drug-addict"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AnemoneWrasslin.AmbushAtWater": "[pg]As Kid A approaches the water, the tigershark bursts out and tackles her to the ground. Instinctively, you think to run in, but Kid A isn't screaming or trying to get away."
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AnemoneWrasslin.DemandWaterToll": "[pg][say: Come on, you blue bitch, time to start paying the toll for <b>my</b> water!] the striped girl commands. Bullying really transcends cultures and species, it seems. Kid A simply glares up at her assailant. [say: Not talking, huh? You need to learn some respect for the alpha here,] the tigershark says while smirking deviously. As she begins rubbing her cock against the anemone, Kid A retaliates and grabs the shark, twisting around and throwing her to the ground. The two tussle in the grass, rolling while locked in heated combat. Thanks to all the training you've given her, however, Kid A ends up the victor. Izma snarls furiously at her, keen to defend her offspring."
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AnemoneWrasslin.SpotKidAtStream": "Striding around camp, you spot Kid A sauntering down to the stream for more water. Already, you can see {0} swimming to shore to meet her. Knowing that sharks and anemones don't always get along so well, you keep close by just in case. Izma, ever watchful of her spawn, quickly joins you."
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AskIzmaAboutNobleShirt.BewilderedBlink": "[pg]Izma blinks in bewilderment. [say: I don't think I'd recognize them if they are still around, and I don't think enough of their minds would have survived the corruption to be of any help.]  "
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AskIzmaAboutNobleShirt.MagicNotHerForte": "[pg]Magic isn't so much her forté, so you don't expect deeper insight than that. It's a stretch, but you ask if she knows where any of those elders are now."
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AskIzmaAboutNobleShirt.PleasantSurpriseHelp": "[pg]You are pleasantly surprised to hear this. Perhaps she can help you out with the predicament, or shed more light at least."
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AskIzmaAboutNobleShirt.StuckZealotShirt": "You pilfered what seemed like a nice shirt from a fanatical zealot, and now it isn't coming off. [if (shirtStage > 2) {What's worse, it's changing|Without a doubt, that's a bad sign}]. Izma furrows her brow at this and rubs her temples. [say: It... is familiar, actually.]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.AskIzmaAboutNobleShirt.WinceElderStory": "[pg][say: It's tough... When I was a child, the elders of my village were experimenting with magic, they wanted the lake that had given our people life for so many generations to be as livable as the shore.] She winces as she strains to recall more details. [say: There were many garments and ceremonial objects. I was only 7, so I wasn't privy to much. I do know that I didn't go through what you're experiencing now, but maybe the elders created that one too?]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.BackToCamp.GrinsWrinklesNose": "[pg][say: Whatever you say.] She grins and wrinkles her nose. [say: It was nice to be by the lake again, but I'm glad to get out of here: farm work isn't exactly stimulating.] You leave Izma to pack up her things and go."
  "Scenes.Izmascene.BackToCamp.HeadBackToCamp": "You tell her to head back to camp; she will be more use to her alpha there."
  "Scenes.Izmascene.BuyBookCombatManual.AskToBuyManual": "You ask Izma if she's willing to part with the book so you can have an additional book for your bookshelf. [say: I don't know. These books are rare. However, I DO have multiple copies of this type of book. I'm willing to let go for 400 gems.]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.BuyBookCombatManual.ConfirmPurchase": "[pg]Do you buy it?"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.BuyBookCombatManual.NotEnoughGems": "[pg]Unfortunately, you don't have enough gems."
  "Scenes.Izmascene.BuyBookEtiquetteGuide.AskToBuyGuide": "You ask Izma if she's willing to part with the book so you can have an additional book for your bookshelf. [say: I don't know. These books are hard to come by. However, I DO have multiple copies of this type of book. I'm willing to let go for 500 gems.]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.BuyBookEtiquetteGuide.ConfirmPurchase": "[pg]Do you buy it?"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.BuyBookEtiquetteGuide.NotEnoughGems": "[pg]Unfortunately, you don't have enough gems."
  "Scenes.Izmascene.BuyBookPorn.AskToBuyPorn": "You ask Izma if she's willing to part with the book so you can have an additional book for your bookshelf. [say: I don't know. This type of book is quite the fine type and I normally don't let go of this book. However, I DO have multiple copies of this type of book. I'm willing to let go for 400 gems.]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.BuyBookPorn.ConfirmPurchase": "[pg]Do you buy it?"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.BuyBookPorn.NotEnoughGems": "[pg]Unfortunately, you don't have enough gems."
  "Scenes.Izmascene.CampCuntManual.NewGuardingStances": "You learn a few new guarding stances that seem rather promising."
  "Scenes.Izmascene.CampCuntManual.OfferCombatManual": "You ask Izma if she'd like to read one of the many issues of the 'Combat Manual' with you. She gives a snigger and grabs a random issue. [say: Of course. But I honestly never thought someone as good as you would need any more tips in combat,] she teases, getting comfy on a rock. You sit beside her to read, and retort that, if anything, you're using the chance to give her combat tips. Izma shoots you a half-hearted dirty look in response, but you think she knows you're teasing her.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.CampCuntManual.QuickSkimConclusion": "After a quick skim you reach the end of the book. You don't learn any new fighting moves, but the refresher on the overall mechanics and flow of combat and strategy helped."
  "Scenes.Izmascene.CampCuntManual.WeightBehindStrikes": "Your read-through of the manual has given you insight into how to put more of your weight behind your strikes without leaving yourself open. Very useful."
  "Scenes.Izmascene.CampCuntManual.YawnAndDepart": "[pg]After about an hour you yawn and stretch, telling Izma that you're going off to do other business. She nods lazily at your words but doesn't look up from her old book. [say: Sure thing [name], I'm just gonna read this for a little while longer,] Izma says. You nod at her, before moving off."
  "Scenes.Izmascene.ChildToggle.AskIzmaAboutChildren": "You ask Izma if she's ever thought about the two of you having children together.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.ChildToggle.DumbfoundedThenGrinning": "She stares at you, dumbfounded for a moment, then her eyes light up and she gives you the widest grin, displaying her shark teeth for an extra layer of formidability. She practically skips over to her chest, flinging it open and all but diving inside, her happily-waving tail giving you an excellent look at her shapely rear. She emerges with a triumphant cry, a small potion vial in her fingers. She pops the cork and gulps it down, then crushes the bottle in her hand and spins to face you, a wickedly happy expression on her face as she saunters towards you. [say: Well then... let's get started, shall we?] she croons.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.ChildToggle.IzmaSheepishThenDetermined": "Izma looks a little sheepish, but then her expression settles into a determined one. [say: Yes, I have. I'd like us to start a family, but if you don't think you're ready yet, I'll keep taking my herbs.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.ChildToggle.KnowingLookAboutChildren": "You give Izma a knowing look and tell her that you're ready to start having children--if she is.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.ChildToggle.PutChildrenOnHold": "You tell Izma that you've been thinking, and that the two of you should put making children together on hold, at least for a while. Izma looks a little upset, but she nods her head. [say: By your command, alpha,] she tells you. She ambles slowly away from you, her hips and ass swaying side to side in a very enticing manner; you think maybe she's trying to tempt you into changing your mind. When you don't speak up, though, she reaches into and rummages through her chest for one of her contraceptive herbs, turning towards you and making sure you can see her taking it.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.ChildToggle.ResumeTryingForChildren": "You tell Izma that you're ready to start trying for children again. She grins with delight and suddenly pounces at you, giving you a kiss that leaves you breathless. Then, while you're recovering from that, she races off and drinks down a slug of that potion--you figure it must be some kind of 'antidote' to the contraceptives already in her system. From the gleam in her eye as she stalks back towards you, it looks like she intends to start making babies right now...[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.ChildToggle.TellHerStopContraceptives": "Do you tell her to stop taking her contraceptives?"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.ChooseIzmaGloves.DemandGloves": "You look her dead in the eye and tell her that you want her gloves.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.ChooseIzmaGloves.MeeklyObeys": "She mulls over your words for a bit, then meekly picks up the gloves off the ground and places them in your hands."
  "Scenes.Izmascene.ChooseIzmaGloves.PointAtGauntlets": "[say: W-what?] she asks, dazed. You point at the hooked gauntlets, currently laying discarded on the beach after the {0}. [say: But that's my weapon! I need it to--][pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.ChooseIzmaGloves.RepeatDemand": "You cut her off with an airy wave of your hand. You remind her who is in charge as you repeat your demand once again, then add that she should be flattered that someone who has proven to be so much stronger wants the weapon that she is using.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.ChooseIzmaTooth.AcceptTooth": "You accept the tooth from her with a polite word of thanks."
  "Scenes.Izmascene.ChooseNotToFlirtWithIzma.ThanksForMeandering": "You thank Izma for the interesting conversation, even if it did end up meandering a bit, and then walk away, leaving her to her private thoughts.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.ChooseToFlirtWithIzma.AsksHerMentalImage": "Smiling back, you ask about her mental image of you being pregnant with her babies. [say: Um...] She trails off."
  "Scenes.Izmascene.ChooseToFlirtWithIzma.CockOutOfSkirt": " But she glances between her legs and sees her massive cock poking out of her skirt."
  "Scenes.Izmascene.ChooseToFlirtWithIzma.CockOverPregnantBelly": "her huge cock barely able to poke past her baby-filled belly, "
  "Scenes.Izmascene.ChooseToFlirtWithIzma.IzmaVividImageRemark": " [say: Though, you do paint a rather vivid image with words...][pg]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.ChooseToFlirtWithIzma.IzmaWeirdConcern": " [say: That's kinda weird, man... I'm not sure the god in charge of this world would allow something like that. It seems too silly.]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.ChooseToFlirtWithIzma.MilkFilledWaddle": "her DD-cups full of milk, watching as she waddles around the camp, is a very attractive one. She smirks at you. [say: You're such a perv.]"
  "Scenes.Izmascene.ChooseToFlirtWithIzma.PregnantBeautyPraise": "You smile at Izma and tell her you appreciate the offer and that you think she'll be beautiful whether she becomes a mommy or a daddy. In fact, the mental image of her heavily pregnant, "
  "Scenes.Izmascene.ChooseToFlirtWithIzma.PurrsAndAdvances": " [say: Oh... you'd be so big and curvy, so sexy,] she purrs. You advance towards her. Leaning in, you mention you're willing to try and make a baby, right here and now. [say: I... oh, wow. We could certainly try,] she replies, grabbing your neck and pulling you in for a kiss."
  "Scenes.Izmascene.ChooseToFlirtWithIzma.RockHardNipples": " But she glances down to behold her rock-hard nipples jutting out."
  "Scenes.Izmascene.ChooseYourIzmaWeapon.GenitalFocusPrompt": "Which of your genitals will you focus on?"
