  "Scenes.Izmascene.NewAmilyMeetsIzma.AmilyHissesAfterReturn": "Amily watches as the tigershark returns to her bedroll, then, quick as lightning, zips over to you and hisses into your ear. [say: Don't think I'm not pissed that you didn't think to talk about this with me beforehand! I'm just not stupid enough to challenge off something that dangerous--I've seen shark-girls take down and EAT minotaurs coming to the lake for a drink!] She pinches you sharply, to express her displeasure.[pg]"
